{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and approach object. If object is grabbable, then take it and check properties. Move and do task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectNearby    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    />  <SubTree ID = RobotTask    />",
